# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included, so hashed files,
# parsed resources and shell scripts are byte-identical on Windows and Linux (ADR-SC-009).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# Binaries are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
